&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.alpha-sense.com" target="_blank"&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="textLayer"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="textLayer"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="textLayer"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="textLayer"&gt;QE partners with engineering teams to own test strategy, coverage, and quality-by-design. We're not a separate QA checkpoint — we enable engineering teams to ship fast with confidence.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="textLayer"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="textLayer"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="textLayer"&gt;
&lt;div class="p-rich_text_section"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You'll lead and manage a team of quality engineers: hiring, performance, and career growth, while staying hands-on enough to make calls on testing, test strategy, and quality debt. Working manager role — technical credibility matters as much as people skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="p-rich_text_section"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You'll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class="p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested" data-stringify-type="unordered-list" data-list-tree="true" data-indent="0" data-border="0"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, manage performance, and drive career growth for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make quality-related technical calls: review MRs, test plans, improve test strategy, drive metrics on test coverage, customer issues, quality debt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own execution and prioritization for your team's quality commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and/or maintain the dashboards and metrics that give visibility into quality health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a proactive, clear quality narrative to your manager and partner teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineering managers, PMs, designers, and peer QE managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up team processes (release pipelines, test planning, escalations, etc) that hold up without you checking every step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a portfolio-level view of quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="p-rich_text_section"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class="p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested" data-stringify-type="unordered-list" data-list-tree="true" data-indent="0" data-border="0"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in a team management role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in quality engineering/quality assurance, Senior/Staff+ level prior to managerial role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced managing QA/QE or test automation engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical depth in test planning, test strategy, automation, and quality metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building tools and processes that other teams adopt and rely on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A coach who gives specific, direct feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="textLayer"&gt;
&lt;div class="p-rich_text_section"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You'll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class="p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested" data-stringify-type="unordered-list" data-list-tree="true" data-indent="0" data-border="0"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, manage performance, and drive career growth for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make quality-related technical calls: review MRs, test plans, improve test strategy, drive metrics on test coverage, customer issues, quality debt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own execution and prioritization for your team's quality commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and/or maintain the dashboards and metrics that give visibility into quality health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a proactive, clear quality narrative to your manager and partner teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineering managers, PMs, designers, and peer QE managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up team processes (release pipelines, test planning, escalations, etc) that hold up without you checking every step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a portfolio-level view of quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="p-rich_text_section"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="p-rich_text_section"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating non-deterministic or generative outputs (LLM/GenAI features)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with eval frameworks, golden datasets, or scoring rubrics for measuring output quality&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge in at least one of: Kotlin, Python, JavaScript, or Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of testing methodologies and QA domain theory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with different test automation frameworks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong test design skills on all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Test Management Systems (e.g., Allure TestOps)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, or Azure) and containerization (Kubernetes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of CI/CD and continuous delivery practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with AI tools, with a track record of using them to raise quality, speed up testing and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to search relevance or ranking quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting up and configuring CI/CD tools and pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of GraphQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Performance Engineering (k6 or similar) and Observability (OpenTelemetry/Grafana)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline;"&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href="http://alpha-sense.com/" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo"&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl"&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:consulting-director-cloud-data:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at CreateFuture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://createfuture.com/" target="_blank"&gt;CreateFuture&lt;/a&gt; is a Version 1 company and an &lt;strong&gt;AI-native consulting partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;where people do work that matters and are supported to do it well. We work alongside organisations such as PayPal, adidas, NatWest, FanDuel and Money Saving Expert, building digital products and services that make a difference&amp;nbsp; while always putting people first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of creators. We write code, shape delivery, build go-to-market strategies, develop AI solutions and create the practices that support our people. We work side by side with our clients, challenging what’s not working and helping them to build the future. Our commitment to craft, quality, and culture has helped us scale to over 600 people in just a few years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our UK Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;35 days leave (including bank holidays).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental and adoption leave.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial coaching + 5% pension match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40 hours of paid learning and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://2429507.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/2429507/CreateFuture%20Benefits%20(2026)%20(1).pdf" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;View our full list of UK benefits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;CreateFuture is a &lt;a href="https://www.greatplacetowork.co.uk/certified-company/1572759" target="_blank"&gt;Great Place to Work-Certified™ company &lt;/a&gt;and has won Best Workplaces UK multiple years in a row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us on our journey. Let’s create tomorrow, together, today.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-renderer-start-pos="2571"&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;About the role and team:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CreateFuture, we help ambitious organisations solve complex business problems through technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We're looking for an experienced AWS consulting leader who has spent their career advising enterprise customers—not simply designing cloud infrastructure, but helping organisations transform how they build products, use data and adopt AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who has worked within AWS as a Senior or Principal Solutions Architect (or within an equivalent consulting organisation) and enjoys working directly with customers to shape strategy, influence executive stakeholders and turn technology into measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You'll join as one of our most senior technical leaders, partnering with clients from early strategy through to delivery while helping shape some of the UK's most exciting Cloud, Data and AI transformation programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It's an exciting time to join us. As part of Version 1, we're investing heavily in our Cloud and AI capability and are proud to be both an &lt;strong&gt;Anthropic Preferred Services Partner&lt;/strong&gt; and an &lt;strong&gt;OpenAI Services Partner&lt;/strong&gt;. This gives our teams the opportunity to work at the forefront of enterprise AI adoption, helping customers move beyond experimentation into meaningful business transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to CIOs, CTOs, CDOs and senior technology leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead executive discovery workshops, strategy engagements and technology roadmapping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape large-scale Cloud, Data and AI transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers modernise legacy platforms using modern cloud-native architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design pragmatic technology roadmaps focused on business outcomes, not just technology choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineering and delivery teams to ensure strategic intent becomes successful execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic opportunities, bids and executive presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior consultants and architects across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent CreateFuture externally through customer events, industry forums and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence the evolution of our Cloud, Data and AI consulting propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="We’d-love-to-talk-to-you-if-you:" data-renderer-start-pos="6821"&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’d love to talk to you if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1t6l1qd" data-start="43" data-end="140"&gt;Experience in enterprise consulting, gained within AWS or a leading technology consultancy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="jis33a" data-start="141" data-end="198"&gt;Principal or Senior Solutions Architect experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="sp5vsr" data-start="199" data-end="285"&gt;Have customer-facing consulting experience, rather than purely internal architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="e4nzqj" data-start="286" data-end="367"&gt;Experience leading enterprise cloud, data, or AI transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="71ubkg" data-start="368" data-end="470"&gt;Experience working with clients across Financial Services, Retail, Gaming, or the Public Sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1cqxroe" data-start="471" data-end="530"&gt;Commercial solution shaping and pre-sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1dh2ymk" data-start="531" data-end="610"&gt;Experience delivering executive presentations and facilitating workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="6y2w3t" data-start="611" data-end="690" data-is-last-node=""&gt;Experience speaking at conferences, customer events, or community forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="_1bsb1osq _18s8y1gf _p12fukw8" data-testid="view-page-labels-container"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h3 id="What-we’ll-offer-you:" data-renderer-start-pos="8044"&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:ai-platform-engineer-berlin-be:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="fabric-text-color-mark" data-renderer-mark="true" data-text-custom-color="#36b37e"&gt;IDnow is a&lt;strong&gt; leader in digital identity and fraud prevention in Europe&lt;/strong&gt; with a mission to transform trust into the most powerful asset in the digital world, empowering enterprises with &lt;strong&gt;AI-driven, SaaS-based identity solutions that deliver scalable security, adaptive compliance, and real-time fraud prevention&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark="true"&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class="fabric-text-color-mark" data-renderer-mark="true" data-text-custom-color="#36b37e"&gt;Through its broad portfolio of digital identity and fraud prevention solutions, IDnow establishes, maintains and enriches trust throughout the customer journey, ensuring businesses can confidently and securely operate while leveraging digital identity to drive growth, security and scalability. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="fabric-text-color-mark" data-renderer-mark="true" data-text-custom-color="#36b37e"&gt;The company has &lt;strong&gt;offices in Germany, United Kingdom, Romania and France&lt;/strong&gt;, and is backed by renowned institutional investors, including Corsair Capital and Seventure Partners. Its &lt;strong&gt;portfolio of international clients spans a wide range of end markets&lt;/strong&gt; including financial services, telecommunications, travel &amp;amp; mobility, gaming, and other industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;This role is based in Berlin/Munich, Germany or Rennes, France.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;IDnow is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;seeking a highly skilled &lt;strong&gt;AI Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;&amp;nbsp;Engineer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;&amp;nbsp;with strong software development capabilities and emerging&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;in AI-driven integration. In this role, you will architect, implement, and optimise integrations across cloud platforms, data systems, and application environments. You will also design and operationalise AI workflows—leveraging&amp;nbsp;automation, machine learning services, and intelligent data pipelines—to enhance business processes and system interoperability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;You will work closely with cross&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;functional&amp;nbsp;teams to implement automation, build reliable&amp;nbsp;integration&amp;nbsp;processes, integrate data services, and deliver robust infrastructure-as-code solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;This position blends integration engineering, DevOps practices, AI tooling, and practical software development, offering the opportunity to shape our next-generation automation and intelligent integration capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 18pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Design and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;scalable integrations across enterprise systems, SaaS platforms, and internal applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;Build and enhance GitLab based CI/CD pipelines to support application integration and infrastructure automation. ‑&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;based CI/CD pipelines to support application&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;Use Terraform (or other Infrastructure as Code tools) to design and provision cloud infrastructure—primarily on AWS.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;Develop automation scripts and workflows to reduce manual operational overhead and improve reliability. &lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;Integrate machine learning and approved AI‑&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;based services into operational workflows and data pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;Implement data integration pipelines using APIs, event-driven architectures, and messaging systems. &lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
